}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9083596471713005", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "38446757044970225"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789148885, "id": "38268578209454777", "version": "7", "version_code": 91, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9083596471713005", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "38446757044970225"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "183605694593935"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed bugs on the deformity manager; \n- You should see correctly the axes and CORA markers even on custom cases. \n- Choosing an independent bone fragment fixed to a ring on another bone fragment (i.e calcaneus on a butt frame) now works as expected, avoiding moving the whole frame as a block. \nFixed a bug on tutorial screen where users could not complete struts, rods and hinges tutorials due to rings not accepting pieces. \nAdditions;\n- Added extension plates for adjacent diameters and 3 above. \n- Added 45 deg. extension plate. \n- Removed golden posts. \n\n", "created_date": 1773281718, "id": "34190721697240469", "version": "7", "version_code": 90, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9083596471713005", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "38446757044970225"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "183605694593935"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed an important issue where Pins and wires placed on an already fixed ring lost position if an important mismatch between controller real world position and drill position was present. ", "created_date": 1773087619, "id": "34151476134498359", "version": "7", "version_code": 89, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9083596471713005", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "38446757044970225"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "183605694593935"}]}, "change_log": "Improved handling of several rings in scene causing glitches. \nCorrection of some hole mismatching in foot rings\nIntroduced strut model selector, strut length calculator (convert total length to gradual and acute values)\nSaving some player preferences on app exit (quickload and fastlock preferences). ", "created_date": 1772329092, "id": "33999713723007935", "version": "7", "version_code": 88, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}